Location: Data represents a train maintenance of an ICE (no distinction between ICE 1 and ICE 2 is made)
Technology: ICE 1 and ICE 2
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: The data of the material composition and energy consumption is based on literature studies. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b9f11fe7-2a63-3b91-98fa-64280ea09493.xml</text>
